,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Edit from @roblourens: to restore the old Edit mode with all models, set `\"chat.edits2.enabled\": false`.\n\n---\n\n```\nVersion: 1.99.0-insider\nCommit: b87fa463df1aeec04bf1f56276cc9972bdb14124\nDate: 2025-03-21T05:04:02.660Z\nElectron: 34.3.2\nElectronBuildId: 11161073\nChromium: 132.0.6834.210\nNode.js: 20.18.3\nV8: 13.2.152.41-electron.0\nOS: Darwin arm64 24.3.0\n```\n\n**Current Behavior:**\n- Sonnet 3.7 reasoning model is no longer available in edit/agent modes\n- Only standard reasoning models are accessible\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\n- Sonnet 3.7 Thinking model should be available in both edit and agent modes\n\n**Impact:**\n- Critical functionality loss\n- Competitive disadvantage against Cursor and Windsurf, which provide reasoning models throughout development workflow\n","closed_by":{"login":"bhavyaus","id":25044782,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDQ0Nzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25044782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus","html_url":"https://github.com/bhavyaus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2742904203","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778#issuecomment-2742904203","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778","id":2742904203,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6jfWWL","user":{"login":"gsusI","id":4558016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTgwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4558016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI","html_url":"https://github.com/gsusI","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T10:08:17Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T10:08:17Z","body":"Why not make all models available in all modes?\n\nI fail to understand how the most powerful AI coding modes, Edit and Agent, can only use the basic models when they are the ones that would benefit the most from reasoning models.\n\nAlso, Edit has been able to use 3.7 thinking up until now.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2742904203/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":4},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2743392856","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778#issuecomment-2743392856","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778","id":2743392856,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6jhNpY","user":{"login":"lramos15","id":4544166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDQxNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4544166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15","html_url":"https://github.com/lramos15","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2025-03-21T13:37:45Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T13:37:45Z","body":"cc @roblourens About the file missing in edits\r\n\r\nAs for agent mode, it's not currently supported as our code does not properly handle the exchanging of thinking tokens back and forth which Anthropic which is required for the reasoning model to make use of tool calling. We're working on this in the background and hope to enable this as quickly as possible. For now, we've seen great success with the non thinking variant of 3.7.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2743392856/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2743598186","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778#issuecomment-2743598186","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778","id":2743598186,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6jh_xq","user":{"login":"gsusI","id":4558016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTgwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4558016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI","html_url":"https://github.com/gsusI","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T14:51:21Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T14:51:21Z","body":"What about Edit? Has it been deliberately removed or is it a bug?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2743598186/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2743613465","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778#issuecomment-2743613465","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778","id":2743613465,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6jiDgZ","user":{"login":"gsusI","id":4558016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTgwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4558016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI","html_url":"https://github.com/gsusI","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T14:55:53Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T14:55:53Z","body":"I understand you're seeing the non-thinking variant working nicely; however, I recommend you give Cursor a go, using agent mode with Sonnet 3.7 thinking (maybe even 3.7 thinking max).\n\nI think the key is that beyond the surface level, as we rely on the agent to perform work in a predictable way, non-thinking models don't scale, as they can get in pretty weird rabbit holes, where they start duplicating existing files with snippets of code and all sorts of weird things. It takes a reasoning model to realise that it's not heading in the right direction. I believe that, whatever reasoning is performed at the app level doesn't compare with that performed at the model level.\n\nAlso, are you guys planning to show the thinking traces? There is huge value on those, in Cursor I love reading through them and understanding where the agent is coming from, helping me build my knowledge as well as cover gaps in the context/knowledge of the agent","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2743613465/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2743725587","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778#issuecomment-2743725587","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778","id":2743725587,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6jie4T","user":{"login":"roblourens","id":323878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzg3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/323878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens","html_url":"https://github.com/roblourens","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2025-03-21T15:29:15Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T15:29:15Z","body":"Edit mode now uses a tool, so models where we can't do tool calling like Claude 3.7 Thinking aren't supported there. If you really want it back, you can disable `chat.unifiedChatView`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2743725587/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2744270822","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778#issuecomment-2744270822","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778","id":2744270822,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6jkj_m","user":{"login":"gsusI","id":4558016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTgwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4558016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI","html_url":"https://github.com/gsusI","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T19:28:48Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T19:28:48Z","body":"Thanks for that, it saved me from rolling back to the previous build!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.gi