the preferred way by the majority (If I go by the feedback I saw on Cursor). People also like that on Windsurf. But Copilot is probably used more in the corporate world vs vibe coder that use Cursor/Windsurf. That's why I opened that feature request which would offer the best of both world: [#multi-tab](https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6131). \n\nThe alternative is to leave it as a flag in the settings like now and let people choose. But one of your biggest problem right now is feature discoverability, you have tons of great stuff hidden behind settings, this just add to that problem. At the same it's VS Code which is very customizable, you just need to make sure you have documentation to support it and that you choose reasonable defaults. \n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2745399504/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2745567756","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778#issuecomment-2745567756","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778","id":2745567756,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6jpgoM","user":{"login":"gsusI","id":4558016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTgwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4558016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI","html_url":"https://github.com/gsusI","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsusI/subscription