ents","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-28T01:20:55Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T01:20:55Z","body":"I want to answer your poll with the first option of the two, as a currently very happy pro sub:\n\n1. Have access to all models in Edit mode, but not be able to switch between modes while in a conversation (switching modes would prompt you to clear the chat session, as it did previously)\n\nFor me, having 3.7 Sonnet Thinking in the Edits tab is very helpful. I don't usually switch models, but I prefer the thinking responses to the non-thinking ones. But keeping it the way it is (with the option to toggle it in the settings) is perfectly fine for me, of course. I highly appreciate all the work you guys put into this!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2759932431/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2765201212","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778#issuecomment-2765201212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/6778","id":2765201212,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6k0Z88","user":{"login":"Chriss4123","id":87142779,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQyNzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87142779?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chriss4123","html_url":"https://github.com/Chriss4123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chriss4123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chriss4123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chriss4123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chriss4123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.